#: arts.cpp:218
msgid ""
"Normally, the sound server defaults to using the device called "
"<b>/dev/dsp</b> for sound output. That should work in most cases. An "
"exception is for instance if you are using devfs, then you should use "
"<b>/dev/sound/dsp</b> instead. Other alternatives are things like "
"<b>/dev/dsp0</b> or <b>/dev/dsp1</b> if you have a soundcard that supports "
"multiple outputs, or you have multiple soundcards."
msgstr ""
"Obično će server zvuka koristiti uređaj pod imenom <b>/dev/dsp</b> za "
"sviranje zvuka. To bi trebalo raditi, no ako se npr. koristi dvfs, onda "
"treba koristit <b>/dev/sound/dsp</b>. Druge mogućnosti su <b>/dev/dsp0</b> "
"ili <b>/dev/dsp1</b> ako imate zvučnu karticu koja podržava višekanalno "
"sviranje ili imate više zvučnih kartica."

#: arts.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Normally, the sound server defaults to using a sampling rate of 44100 Hz (CD "
"quality), which is supported on almost any hardware. If you are using "
"certain <b>Yamaha soundcards</b>, you might need to configure this to 48000 "
"Hz here, if you are using <b>old SoundBlaster cards</b>, like SoundBlaster "
"Pro, you might need to change this to 22050 Hz. All other values are "
"possible, too, and may make sense in certain contexts (i.e. professional "
"studio equipment)."
msgstr ""
"Obično se koristi frekvencija uzrokovanja od 44,100Hz (CD kvaliteta zvuka), "
"koja je podržana od skoro svih kartica, no ako koristiti neke <b>Yamaha "
"kartice</b>, tada bi trebali podesiti ovu vrijednost na 48,000Hz, dok "
"<b>stare SoundBlaster (Pro)</b>"
" kartice traže vrijednost od 22,500Hz. Druge vrijednosti su moguće i mogu "
"imati svrhe kod profesionalnih uređaja."

#: arts.cpp:222
msgid ""
"This configuration module is intended to cover almost every aspect of the "
"aRts sound server that you can configure. However, there are some things "
"which may not be available here, so you can add <b>command line options</b> "
"here which will be passed directly to <b>artsd</b>"
". The command line options will override the choices made in the GUI. To see "
"the possible choices, open a Konsole window, and type <b>artsd -h</b>."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul je namijenjen za podešavanje svih mogućnosti servera zvuka "
"(aRts). Ipak, ako nečega nema, može se podesiti tako da dodate <b> "
"vrijednosti u zapovjednom redu</b> ovdje, a koje će biti poslane ravno u "
"<b>artsc</b>. Podašavanja u zapovjednom redu će zaobići vaše izbore u "
"GUI-ju. Ako želite vidjeti moguće izbore, otvorite Konsole prozor i "
"ukucajte <b>'artsd -h'</b> ."

#: arts.cpp:419
msgid ""
"The settings have changed since the last time you restarted the sound "
"server.\n"
"Do you want to save them?"
msgstr ""
"Postavke su promijenjene od zadnjeg puta kada ste pokrenuli server zvuka.\n"
"Da li ih želite snimiti?"

#: arts.cpp:422
msgid "Save Sound Server Settings?"
msgstr "Snimi postavke servera zvuka?"

#: arts.cpp:467
msgid ""
"Restart sound server now?\n"
"\n"
"Restarting the sound server might confuse or even crash applications using "
"the sound server."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo pokrenuti server zvuka?\n"
"\n"
"Ponovno pokretanje servera zvuka može zbuniti ili srušiti neke progame "
"koji koriste server zvuka."

#: arts.cpp:472
msgid "Restart Sound Server Now?"
msgstr "Ponovo pokrenuti server zvuka?"

#: arts.cpp:474
msgid ""
"Stop sound server now?\n"
"\n"
"This might confuse or even crash applications using the sound server."
msgstr ""
"Ugasiti server zvuka?\n"
"\n"
"To može zbuniti ili srušiti neke programe koji ga koriste."

#: arts.cpp:478
msgid "Stop Sound Server Now?"
msgstr "Zaustavi server zvuka sada?"

#: arts.cpp:481
msgid "Start sound server?"
msgstr "Pokreni server zvuka?"

#: arts.cpp:482
