msgstr "Pokreni server zvuka sada?"

#: arts.cpp:546
msgid ""
"<h1>The aRts sound server</h1> Here you can configure aRts, KDE's sound "
"server. This program not only allows you to hear your system sounds while "
"simultaneously listening to some MP3 file or playing a game with a "
"background music. It also allows you to apply different effects to your "
"system sounds and provides programmers with an easy way to achieve sound "
"support."
msgstr ""
"<h1>aRts server zvuka</h1>"
" Ovdje možete podesiti aRts, KDE-ov server zvuka. On omogućava da u isto "
"vrijeme slušate sistemsko zvono, MP3 muziku ili igru zajedno sa muzikom u "
"pozadini, a također možete primijeniti razne zvukove za sistemske poruke, "
"a programiranje zvuka je pomoću njega značajno olakšano."

#: arts.cpp:556
msgid "kcmarts"
msgstr "kcmarts"

