#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Enable full &duplex operation"
msgstr "Omogući puni &dvosmjerni rad"

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid ""
"This enables the soundserver to record and play sound at the same time. If "
"you use applications like Internet telephony, voice recognition or similar, "
"you probably want this."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućuje serveru zvuka da snima i svira zvuk u isto vrijeme. Ako "
"koristite npr. internet telefoniju, kontrolu glasa ili imate slične "
"zahtjeve onda vam ovo treba."

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "&Use custom sound device:"
