#: rc.cpp:37
msgid ""
"If you are using a Yamaha soundcard, you might need to set the sampling rate "
"to 48000 Hz."
msgstr ""
"Ako koristite Yamaha zvučnu karticu, možda trebate podesiti frekvenciju "
"uzrokovanja na 48 000 Hz."

